#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "KSudoku is a free version of the popular logic game Sudoku for the KDE "
#| "desktop. The game is to fill a nine by nine grid with the numbers from "
#| "one to nine filling the rows, columns and three by three squares without "
#| "repeating a value on them."
msgid ""
"KSudoku is a free version of the popular logic game Sudoku developed by the "
"KDE community. The game is to fill a nine by nine grid with the numbers from "
"one to nine filling the rows, columns and three by three squares without "
"repeating a value on them."
msgstr ""
"KSudoku é unha versión libre do popular xogo de lóxica Sudoku para o "
"escritorio de KDE. O xogo consiste en encher as celas dunha grade de 9x9 cos "
"números do 1 ao 9, enchendo as filas, columnas e bloques de 3x3 con valores "
"que non se repitan."
